{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/0d8235391a0b0b0fbcf2ac52afc54ab7.avif?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon crawling! Bloodthirsty monsters! Promiscuous protagonists!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing the Dungeon of Erotic Master (a.k.a. &quot;DunEro&quot;) Reboot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/93d0b0a2e3b72a050c71f2398df0eb25.webp?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a certain kingdom, there are three female warriors who are quite popular in their adventuring party\u30fcso much so that they're thought to be the group's next leaders. However, they have their vices\u2026 After sleeping with men every single night, they've managed to build up a serious debt at their guild. At this rate, it's going to have an effect on their promotion exams\u2026 However, just as the three slutty swordsmen are about to give up hope, they're approached by Mangis, a shopkeeper and debt collector, who gives them a quest. She wants them to find the corpse of her grandfather who ventured into a dungeon and never returned. Wanting to give her beloved grandfather a proper burial, she's hired many mercenaries to do the job, but they seem to have gone in pretty deep\u2026 As their name suggests, the ruins are filled with tons of bloodthirsty monsters. Our heroines will have to face 22 levels of dungeon crawling madness to find the lost adventurer king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/3d2c7f1d11bc18e068d105aeafefa896.webp?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/2da7217784d79d796e903c999922fab1.avif?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/2970e078853bf0009dce1dbf541487b7.avif?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/e8fcbefb1bc56d1ef986ce7ff517dcdf.avif?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/fb7f63d0b470008d53928a84b4db4f9b.avif?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779390/extras/52cb92ecd1204afb4f9172b9c1161c4c.webp?t=1760343953\" width=1232 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Note: &quot;Dungeon of Erotic Master Reboot&quot; is a remake of &quot;Dungeon of Erotic Master&quot; (a.k.a. DunEro), the third title and first RPG from Rushimarudo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW engine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW content!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW character!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plus...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 22-floor dungeon to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items and equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story elements and CG have been changed and/or added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragra